cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this
  file, and cite the paper listed under "preferred-citation" describing
  Pegasus. If your work was supported by Pegasus, please also include the
  acknowledgment statement described at
  https://pegasus.isi.edu/about/acknowledge/.
type: software
title: Pegasus Workflow Management System
abstract: >-
  Pegasus is a workflow management system for mapping and executing
  scientific workflow-based applications across a variety of computing
  environments, including desktops, campus clusters, grids, and clouds.
